        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Sector workforce programs should demonstrate provider-specific, long-horizon earnings evidence before expansion.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "WorkAdvance’s four-site randomized evaluation reports pooled earnings gains but uneven provider-specific results. Its net-gain models depend on provider, accounting perspective, and horizon, so they do not justify a universal expansion or a cross-site ranking.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
